How can you fit in on LinkedIn? 
How can you speak the language of AI without _using_ AI?&lt;p&gt;https://github.com/blater/claudify&lt;p&gt;Carefully hand craft your prose, then hand it to Claudify. It uses non-AI deterministic heuristics to warp, crush, pulverize, and algorithmically dehumanise into beautiful, fluent Claudish.&lt;p&gt;LinkedIn-ready, instantly, with &lt;i&gt;no AI&lt;/i&gt;. Because using AI to generate AI slop would just be embarrassing.&lt;p&gt;Every slice lands, every seam is honest. It's load bearing.&lt;/p&gt;
